#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1364 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Rows 1-3: the three untreated ARMNRS reasons carry empty ACTARMCD/ACTARM. Row 4: a treated subject has no ARMNRS. Row 5 boundary: 'UNPLANNED TREATMENT' is outside the FDA rule text's three reasons, so it is not flagged here."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
col ACTARM   type=Char label="Description of Actual Arm"
col ARMNRS   type=Char label="Reason Arm and/or Actual Arm is Null"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015 |   |       | SCREEN FAILURE
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1023 |   |       | NOT ASSIGNED
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1028 |   |       | ASSIGNED, NOT TREATED
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1034 | A | Arm A |
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1047 | A | Arm A | UNPLANNED TREATMENT
